    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86322" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρηγορεών</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶνος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>crop</i> of birds, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				374
			</span></i> (metaph. of Cleon), <i><span class="en">
				<u>Av.</u>
				1113
			</span></i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρηγορῶνα, -ῶνας</span> cj.
			Bentley); from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρό, ἀγείρω,</span>
			because birds <i>collect</i> their food there <i>before</i> it
			passes into the second stomach, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.204
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				688.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>, Apollonius ap.<i><span class="en">
				Zonar.
			</span></i>: written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προηγορεών</span></b> , <u>EM</u>l.c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i></div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
